sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cashier
    participant POSUI as POS Terminal UI
    participant SQLite as Local SQLite DB
    participant Outbox as Sync Outbox Table
    participant SyncEng as POS SyncEngine
    participant Gateway as Backend Gateway (/sync/ingest)
    participant CloudDB as Central PostgreSQL 16
    participant Redis as Redis Event Bus

    Note over Cashier,Outbox: Network Connectivity DOWN (Offline Mode)
    Cashier->>POSUI: Scan barcode (e.g., 6224011439398)
    POSUI->>SQLite: Query cached product & stock
    SQLite-->>POSUI: Product: Dina Farms Cottage Cheese (69 EGP)
    Cashier->>POSUI: Press [F2] Pay Cash (Tendered 100 EGP)
    POSUI->>SQLite: Record local transaction & print receipt
    POSUI->>Outbox: INSERT into sync_outbox (UUID, payload, status='PENDING')
    POSUI-->>Cashier: Sale Completed Offline (Receipt Generated)

    Note over Outbox,Gateway: Network Restored (Online Mode)
    SyncEng->>SyncEng: Connectivity poll detected network UP
    SyncEng->>Outbox: SELECT * FROM sync_outbox WHERE status='PENDING'
    Outbox-->>SyncEng: Pending transactions batch
    SyncEng->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/sync/ingest {terminal_id, events}
    Gateway->>CloudDB: Verify event UUID (Idempotency Check)
    alt New Event
        Gateway->>CloudDB: INSERT into orders & order_items
        Gateway->>CloudDB: Deduct stock from inventory
        Gateway->>Redis: Publish 'inventory.updated'
        Gateway-->>SyncEng: 200 OK {processed: 1, duplicates: 0}
        SyncEng->>Outbox: UPDATE sync_outbox SET status='SYNCED'
    else Duplicate Event
        Gateway-->>SyncEng: 200 OK {processed: 0, duplicates: 1}
        SyncEng->>Outbox: UPDATE sync_outbox SET status='SYNCED'
    end
